;; og:preserve-this hud-results rung: this method's own body is withheld,
;; not decoded. It is a huge text-message-id dispatch ladder that spills
;; one hud-item-string pointer to the stack once and reloads it across
;; roughly a dozen sibling branches; every one of the ~40 individual
